  "interpretation": "The three complex C3 characters remain distinct over Q(omega), but coalesce at the prime above 3. Their modular residue is not lost arbitrarily: it becomes twelve exact six-tritangent conservation laws organized as four Hesse direction classes. This supplies an arithmetic interface between the Clifford virtual-machine compiler and the Cartan cubic without identifying their unrelated 24-dimensional kernels.",
